# guava 32.1.2 is shaded inside graphql-java (package graphql.com.google.common), so it cannot be upgraded on its own.
# No graphql-java release fixes it (24.3, 25.1, 26.0 and 26.1 all ship 32.1.2). The CVE is a denial of service through Java
# deserialization of attacker-controlled Guava collections; this service never deserializes untrusted Java objects.
# Revisit when graphql-java ships a newer guava.
